lse,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":4,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"NRI tag for report tone and session timing"},{"qid":"MI5","module_code":"INTAKE","type":"single","text_en":"Which language do you want your report in?","text_hi":"आप अपनी रिपोर्ट किस भाषा में चाहते हैं?","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":5,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MG1","module_code":"GATE","type":"multi","text_en":"Where do you need support right now? (choose up to 2)","text_hi":"अभी आपको किस बात में सहारे की ज़रूरत है? (ज़्यादा से ज़्यादा 2 चुनें)","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":6,"is_protected":true,"source_note":"Max 2. Order by MI3 (see README)."},{"qid":"MC1","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel calm and in control of my day.","text_hi":"मैं अपने दिन को लेकर शांत और नियंत्रण में महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":7,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MC2","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I sleep well and wake up feeling rested.","text_hi":"मैं अच्छी नींद लेता/लेती हूँ और उठकर तरोताज़ा महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":8,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MC3","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel tired even after resting.","text_hi":"आराम करने के बाद भी मैं थका/थकी हुआ महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":9,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MC4","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I find it hard to focus on what I am doing.","text_hi":"जो काम कर रहा/रही हूँ, उस पर ध्यान लगाना मुश्किल लगता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":10,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MC5","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel overwhelmed by everything I have to handle.","text_hi":"मुझे जो कुछ संभालना है, उससे मैं दबा हुआ/हुई महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":11,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MC6","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I still enjoy the things I usually like to do.","text_hi":"जो चीज़ें मुझे आमतौर पर पसंद हैं, उनमें मुझे अब भी मज़ा आता है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":12,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MC7","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I have someone I can talk to about how I feel.","text_hi":"मेरे पास कोई है जिससे मैं अपनी भावनाओं के बारे में बात कर सकता/सकती हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":13,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"MC7 raw = Never also adds the Isolation point (Scoring step 10)"},{"qid":"MC8","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I get irritated or angry more easily than before.","text_hi":"मैं पहले से ज़्यादा जल्दी चिढ़ जाता/जाती हूँ या गुस्सा हो जाता/जाती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":14,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MC9","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel good about myself.","text_hi":"मैं अपने बारे में अच्छा महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":15,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MC10","module_code":"MCORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel hopeful about the coming months.","text_hi":"आने वाले महीनों को लेकर मुझे उम्मीद है।","reverse":true,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":16,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Not in severity; used for report tone"},{"qid":"H1","module_code":"H","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel nervous, anxious or on edge.","text_hi":"मैं घबराया/घबराई हुआ, बेचैन या तनाव में महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":17,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"H2","module_code":"H","type":"likert","text_en":"I cannot stop or control my worrying.","text_hi":"मैं अपनी चिंता को रोक या काबू नहीं कर पाता/पाती।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":18,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"H3","module_code":"H","type":"likert","text_en":"I worry about many different things at once.","text_hi":"मैं एक साथ कई अलग-अलग बातों की चिंता करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":19,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"H4","module_code":"H","type":"likert","text_en":"I get sudden waves of strong fear, with a racing heart, sweating or breathlessness.","text_hi":"मुझे अचानक तेज़ डर के दौरे आते हैं, जिनमें दिल तेज़ धड़कता है, पसीना आता है या साँस फूलती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":20,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"H4 ≥ 2 shows MR3 (physical check)"},{"qid":"H5","module_code":"H","type":"likert","text_en":"I avoid places or situations because they make me anxious.","text_hi":"मैं कुछ जगहों या स्थितियों से बचता/बचती हूँ क्योंकि उनसे मुझे घबराहट होती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":21,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"H6","module_code":"H","type":"likert","text_en":"I keep imagining the worst that could happen.","text_hi":"मैं बार-बार सोचता/सोचती हूँ कि सबसे बुरा क्या हो सकता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":22,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"H7","module_code":"H","type":"likert","text_en":"I worry a lot about my health even after a doctor says I am fine.","text_hi":"डॉक्टर के ठीक बताने के बाद भी मुझे अपनी सेहत की बहुत चिंता रहती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":23,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"H8","module_code":"H","type":"likert","text_en":"Worry makes it hard for me to relax or fall asleep.","text_hi":"चिंता के कारण मुझे आराम करना या सोना मुश्किल लगता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":24,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"L1","module_code":"L","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel down, low or hopeless.","text_hi":"मैं उदास, निराश या टूटा हुआ/हुई महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":25,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"L2","module_code":"L","type":"likert","text_en":"I have little interest or pleasure in doing things.","text_hi":"चीज़ें करने में मेरी रुचि या खुशी बहुत कम हो गई है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":26,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"L3","module_code":"L","type":"likert","text_en":"I have very little energy to get through the day.","text_hi":"दिन निकालने के लिए मेरे पास बहुत कम ऊर्जा होती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":27,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"L4","module_code":"L","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel like a failure, or that I have let people down.","text_hi":"मुझे लगता है कि मैं असफल हूँ, या मैंने लोगों को निराश किया है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":28,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"L5","module_code":"L","type":"likert","text_en":"My appetite has changed a lot — eating much more or much less.","text_hi":"मेरी भूख बहुत बदल गई है — बहुत ज़्यादा या बहुत कम खाना।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":29,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"L6","module_code":"L","type":"likert","text_en":"I have pulled away from friends and family.","text_hi":"मैं दोस्तों और परिवार से दूर हो गया/गई हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":30,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"L7","module_code":"L","type":"likert","text_en":"Small daily tasks feel like a big effort.","text_hi":"रोज़ के छोटे काम भी बहुत भारी लगते हैं।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":31,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"L8","module_code":"L","type":"likert","text_en":"I cry, or feel like crying, more than usual.","text_hi":"मैं आमतौर से ज़्यादा रोता/रोती हूँ, या रोने का मन करता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":32,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"W1","module_code":"W","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel emotionally drained by 