t":40,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"K1","module_code":"K","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel heavy pressure to score well or succeed.","text_hi":"मुझ पर अच्छे नंबर लाने या सफल होने का भारी दबाव है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":41,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"K2","module_code":"K","type":"likert","text_en":"I compare myself with others and feel I am behind.","text_hi":"मैं खुद की तुलना दूसरों से करता/करती हूँ और पीछे महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":42,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"K3","module_code":"K","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel confused about my career or future direction.","text_hi":"मैं अपने करियर या भविष्य की दिशा को लेकर उलझन में हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":43,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"K4","module_code":"K","type":"likert","text_en":"My family's expectations weigh heavily on me.","text_hi":"परिवार की उम्मीदें मुझ पर भारी पड़ती हैं।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":44,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"K5","module_code":"K","type":"likert","text_en":"I keep putting things off, then feel guilty about it.","text_hi":"मैं काम टालता/टालती रहता/रहती हूँ, फिर उसके लिए अपराधबोध होता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":45,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"K6","module_code":"K","type":"likert","text_en":"Exams, interviews or results make me panic.","text_hi":"परीक्षा, इंटरव्यू या रिज़ल्ट से मुझे बहुत घबराहट होती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":46,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"K7","module_code":"K","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel worse about myself after time on social media.","text_hi":"सोशल मीडिया पर समय बिताने के बाद मैं अपने बारे में और बुरा महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":47,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"K8","module_code":"K","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel confident about my abilities.","text_hi":"मुझे अपनी काबिलियत पर भरोसा है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":48,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"MD1","module_code":"DOSE","type":"single","text_en":"How long has this been troubling you?","text_hi":"यह समस्या आपको कब से परेशान कर रही है?","reverse":false,"scored":"points","path":"all","sort":49,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Duration points 0–3"},{"qid":"MD2","module_code":"DOSE","type":"single","text_en":"How much does it affect your daily life — work, studies, sleep or relationships?","text_hi":"यह आपकी रोज़ की ज़िंदगी — काम, पढ़ाई, नींद या रिश्तों — पर कितना असर डालता है?","reverse":false,"scored":"points","path":"all","sort":50,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Impact points 0–3"},{"qid":"MD3","module_code":"DOSE","type":"single","text_en":"What have you tried so far?","text_hi":"अब तक आपने क्या-क्या कोशिश की है?","reverse":false,"scored":"points","path":"all","sort":51,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"+1 if ≥ 2"},{"qid":"MD4","module_code":"DOSE","type":"single","text_en":"I am ready to put in weekly effort for the next 2–3 months.","text_hi":"मैं अगले 2–3 महीनों तक हर हफ्ते मेहनत करने के लिए तैयार हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":52,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Report tone + counsellor note"},{"qid":"MR1","module_code":"FLAG","type":"multi","text_en":"Do you have any of these? (choose all that apply)","text_hi":"क्या आपको इनमें से कुछ है? (जो लागू हों सब चुनें)","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":53,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Feeds MED_MIND_GENERAL"},{"qid":"MR2","module_code":"FLAG","type":"yn","text_en":"Did this start suddenly (within a few weeks) after an illness, surgery, new medicine or childbirth?","text_hi":"क्या यह किसी बीमारी, सर्जरी, नई दवा या बच्चे के जन्म के बाद अचानक (कुछ हफ्तों में) शुरू हुआ?","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":54,"is_protected":fals